## 4. Production Code Recipes

The following recipes demonstrate production-grade Chain-of-Thought architectures built with Python 3.11+, TypeScript / Node.js, Pydantic v2, and Anthropic Claude / OpenAI APIs, enforcing rigid XML scratchpad isolation, intermediate assertion parsing, streaming state buffers, and programmatic schema validation.

### Recipe 01.01: Production XML Scratchpad Pipeline with Pydantic Extraction

This recipe implements an enterprise prompt wrapper that forces the model to conduct its step-by-step reasoning within an XML `<scratchpad>` block and emit a strictly validated JSON payload. The scratchpad is stripped from the customer-facing response but logged to internal observability pipelines for forensic auditing.
